<!-- ===== US vs the World rotation (RRG) ===== -->
{% if RG %}
<div class="panel">
  <div class="sec-h"><h2>{{ t('US vs the World — capital rotation', '美国 vs 全球 — 资本轮动') }} {{ help('A relative-rotation map. Each market’s relative-strength line vs the US (S&P 500 price index, already in USD) is placed by RELATIVE LEVEL (left↔right: behind vs ahead of the US over the past year) and RELATIVE MOMENTUM (down↔up: losing vs gaining ground). The four corners: Leading (ahead & accelerating), Weakening (ahead but rolling over), Improving (behind but catching up), Lagging (behind & still slipping). The tilt verdict reads whether capital is, net, rotating out of US exceptionalism. Display-only.', '相对轮动图。每个市场相对美国（标普500价格指数，已是美元）的相对强弱线，按相对水平（左右：过去一年落后/领先美国）与相对动量（上下：失去/获得动能）定位。四角：领先（领先且加速）、走弱（领先但回落）、改善（落后但追赶）、落后（落后且继续下滑）。倾向判断衡量资本是否净流出美国例外论。仅供展示。') }}</h2>
    <span style="flex:1"></span><span class="tilt {{ RG.tilt }}">{{ t(RG.tilt_en, RG.tilt_zh) }}</span></div>
  <div class="twocol">
    <div class="rrg">
      <div class="ax h"></div><div class="ax v"></div>
      <div class="ql impr">↖ {{ t('Improving', '改善') }}</div><div class="ql lead">{{ t('Leading', '领先') }} ↗</div>
      <div class="ql lag">↙ {{ t('Lagging', '落后') }}</div><div class="ql weak">{{ t('Weakening', '走弱') }} ↘</div>
      <div class="axl" style="left:6px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)">{{ t('behind US', '落后美国') }}</div>
      <div class="axl" style="right:6px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)">{{ t('ahead', '领先') }}</div>
      {% for r in RG.rows %}
        {% set lv = [[r.rs_level, 60]|max, 140]|min %}
        {% set mo = [[r.rs_mom, -25]|max, 25]|min %}
        {% set xp = 8 + (lv - 60) / 80 * 84 %}
        {% set yp = 8 + (25 - mo) / 50 * 84 %}
        <div class="pt q-{{ r.q }}" style="left:{{ '%.1f'|format(xp) }}%;top:{{ '%.1f'|format(yp) }}%" title="{{ r.name }} · level {{ r.rs_level }} · mom {{ r.rs_mom }}">
          <div class="dot"></div><div class="e">{{ r.flag }}</div><div class="n">{{ r.cc }}</div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <table class="sb">
        <thead><tr><th class="l">{{ t('Market', '市场') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('Phase', '阶段') }}</th><th>{{ t('vs US 3m', '对美3月') }}</th><th>{{ t('6m', '6月') }}</th><th>{{ t('12m', '12月') }}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for r in RG.rows %}
          <tr><td class="l"><span class="flg">{{ r.flag }}</span>{{ t(r.name, r.name_zh) }}</td>
            <td class="l"><span class="tilt q-{{ r.q }}" style="padding:2px 8px;font-size:11px">{% if r.q=='lead' %}{{ t('Leading','领先') }}{% elif r.q=='impr' %}{{ t('Improving','改善') }}{% elif r.q=='weak' %}{{ t('Weakening','走弱') }}{% else %}{{ t('Lagging','落后') }}{% endif %}</span></td>
            <td class="{{ 'pos' if (r.rel_ret.get('3m') or 0) >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{% if r.rel_ret.get('3m') is not none %}{{ '%+.1f'|format(r.rel_ret['3m']) }}%{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
            <td class="{{ 'pos' if (r.rel_ret.get('6m') or 0) >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{% if r.rel_ret.get('6m') is not none %}{{ '%+.1f'|format(r.rel_ret['6m']) }}%{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
            <td class="{{ 'pos' if (r.rel_ret.get('12m') or 0) >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{% if r.rel_ret.get('12m') is not none %}{{ '%+.1f'|format(r.rel_ret['12m']) }}%{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
          </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="caveat" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Relative to the S&P 500 price index (USD). Positive = the market out-ran the US over that window. A relative-strength lens, not a forward-edge claim.', '相对标普500价格指数（美元）。正值 = 该市场在该周期跑赢美国。相对强弱视角，非前瞻收益主张。') }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{% endif %}

<!-- ===== Cross-country comparison grid (the reference table) ===== -->
<div class="panel">
  <h2>{{ t('Cross-country comparison', '跨国对比') }} {{ help('Every economy on the same axes. Regime = growth×inflation quad (with confidence). Recession & drawdown-risk are 0-100 history-anchored display gauges. Real yield = 10y − latest CPI. CPI/GDP/unemployment show the latest official print with its as-of month (greyed when stale — FRED OECD series are discontinued for several economies). The 1Y spark is the index in USD.', '所有经济体使用相同坐标轴。周期 = 增长×通胀象限（含置信度）。衰退与回撤风险为 0-100 历史锚定展示型刻度。实际收益 = 10年 − 最新 CPI。CPI/GDP/失业率显示最新官方数据及截至月份（滞后则置灰 — 多国 FRED OECD 序列已停更）。1年走势为美元计指数。') }}</h2>
  <div class="gridwrap">
  <table class="cmp">
